\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Bariatric Surgery<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Gastric sleeve, gastric bypass and gastric balloon in a supportive, respectful setting.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"medlux-more wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/health\/clinical-treatments\/bariatric-surgery\/\">Learn more \u2192<\/a><\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-ai-m881.jpg\" alt=\"Doctor measuring a patient&#x27;s blood pressure\" class=\"wp-image-1081\" srcset=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-ai-m881.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-ai-m881-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-ai-m881-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-ai-m881-768x512.jpg 768w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-ai-m881-18x12.jpg 18w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1536px) 100vw, 1536px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Check-Up Packages<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Comprehensive health check-ups for men and women, tailored to every stage of life.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"medlux-more wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/health\/clinical-treatments\/check-up-packages\/\">Learn more \u2192<\/a><\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1280\" height=\"960\" src=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-photo-336.jpg\" alt=\"Woman relaxing during an IV infusion\" class=\"wp-image-882\" srcset=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-photo-336.jpg 1280w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-photo-336-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-photo-336-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-photo-336-768x576.jpg 768w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-photo-336-16x12.jpg 16w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">IV Treatments<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Vitamin and nutrient infusions to support energy, regeneration and well-being.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"medlux-more wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/health\/clinical-treatments\/iv-treatments\/\">Learn more \u2192<\/a><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How MedLuxLife supports you<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-steps is-layout-grid wp-container-core-group-is-layout-5e4b10ce wp-block-group-is-layout-grid\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">1. Free consultation<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Share your wishes and, if available, recent X-rays or photos. We answer your questions and explain the options.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">2. Personal treatment plan<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Our partner specialists prepare a treatment plan and an estimated timeline tailored to you.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">3. Travel &amp; treatment<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We coordinate your appointments, hotel and airport transfers, so you can focus on your treatment.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">4. Aftercare<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We stay in touch after you return home and help with follow-up questions.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-cta has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Plan your treatment with confidence<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Every treatment begins with a personal, no-obligation consultation. Contact us and we will get back to you as soon as possible.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button medlux-btn-primary\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/contact\/\">Request a Free Consultation<\/a><\/div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button medlux-btn-whatsapp\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https:\/\/wa.me\/380979092326\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">WhatsApp<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"medlux-disclaimer wp-block-paragraph\">The information on this page is for general guidance only and does not replace a medical consultation. Suitability for any treatment is assessed individually by a qualified doctor.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false,"block_version":1},"excerpt":{"raw":"","rendered":"<p>Our clinical treatments cover aesthetic, dental and hair treatm